  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 103.06 Other Organizational Rules. The board is part of the office of professional licensure and certification. Information such as the board’s office location, address, and telephone number may be found at Plc 103.03. Information regarding the public’s access to minutes and how to request information may be found at Plc 104.\n\nSource. #12993, eff 2-22-20 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Phy 100); ss by #14385, eff 9-23-25\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRule | Statute\n\nPhy 101 | RSA 541-A:16, I(a)\n\nPhy 102.01 | RSA 328-A:2, I\n\nPhy 102.02 | RSA 328-A:2, VII\n\nPhy 102.03 | RSA 328-A:2, IX\n\nPhy 102.04 | RSA 328-A:2, VIII\n\nPhy 103.01 | RSA 328-F:4, VI\n\nPhy 103.02 (reserved) | 2023, 79:277, eff. Sept. 1, 2023\n\nPhy 103.03(a) | RSA 328-A:3, II; RSA 328-F:11, I(a)\n\nPhy 103.03(b) | RSA 328-F:11, I(b)\n\nPhy 103.03(c) | RSA 328-A:3, III\n\nPhy 103.03(d) | RSA 328-A:3, VIII; 2021, 197:24, I, eff. July 1, 2021\n\nPhy 103.04(a) | RSA 328-A:3, III\n\nPhy 103.04(b) | RSA 541-A:16(b)\n\nPhy 103.05 | RSA 91-A:2, II\n\nPhy 103.06 | RSA 310:4, II(e); RSA 328-F:13 repealed by 2023, 79:277, eff. Sept. 1, 2023",
